# Generate MLS glossary board scene asset

## Goal

Generate one course scene PNG at `course-assets/scenes/module-glossary/mGLO_LGLOA_b10_mls-board.png`.

## Scope

- Use the attached BMH course doodle references and locked flat sticker-sheet style.
- Create one 1600 x 900 PNG.
- Compose a large simple teaching board on a plain stand occupying the left 55 percent of the frame.
- Leave the right 45 percent as open cornflower blue for a later presenter.
- Show only the board, stand, and text flow.
- Put the hand-lettered heading `MULTIPLE LISTING SERVICE` at the top of the board.
- Put the hand-lettered flow below it: `MLS` arrow `AGENT LISTING` arrow `PUBLIC SITES`.
- Use only these text strings: `MULTIPLE LISTING SERVICE`, `MLS`, `AGENT LISTING`, `PUBLIC SITES`.
- Use cornflower blue `#62b3f3`, thick rounded black hand-drawn outlines, slight wobble, flat fills only, and the locked palette: yellow, orange, cream, white, and black.
- Avoid extra props, decor, ambient doodles, people, faces, hands, clutter, gradients, texture, shadows, lighting, perspective, and any additional text.

## Verification

- Confirm the file exists at the requested path.
- Confirm the file is a PNG at 1600 x 900.
- Visually inspect for the left-board and right-open-space composition.
- Confirm the only visible text is exactly the four required strings.
- Confirm there are no extra objects or ambient doodles.

